  "abstract": "Production-grade general-purpose writing and revision system for drafting, rewriting, line editing, review, humanisation, and adaptation. It protects factual and literal fidelity, applies genre-aware staged revision, uses publication-informed original examples to improve natural structure and long-prose digestibility, restores individual voice without fabricated personality, includes relation-first punctuation and sentence-flow transformations, and provides a researched contextual catalogue that removes or rewrites formulaic language without treating ordinary words as authorship evidence.",
